 ive and first-generation Arab American\, she’s known for her witty stand-
 up and character-driven sketches that blend a cross-cultural perspective wi
 th relatable humor. Her debut tour\, “The Diversity Fire\,” has sold ou
 t shows around the world\, building a global fanbase along the way.\n\nShe
 ’s been featured at the Netflix Is A Joke Comedy Festival\, on The Stand 
 Up Sketch Show\, and Sirius XM\, and was selected for both NBC’s Late Nig
 ht Writing Program\, the Warner Bros. Creator Program\, and as a writer on 
 the Disney TV Discovers Showcase. Her recent Dry Bar Comedy special\, "Ethn
 ic\, Ambiguous & Single\," is out now.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2
